  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, combine shrimp, mussels, clams, garlic, onion, bell pepper, and tomato.",
    "Drizzle olive oil over the seafood mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Pour seafood stock into a small bowl and brush onto the grill grates.",
    "Add the seafood mixture to the grill and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir the seafood mixture and continue cooking for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Season with smoked paprika, if using.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley or cilantro."
